    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市如<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳所知，\n是咖啡館林立的飲品店激戰區。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E02598200100003110000FF01014F6059B3624077E5FF0C000A662F54965561992867977ACB768498F254C15E976FC062305340300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要研發能戰勝競爭對手的\n新菜單，我看上了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8689817814767C80FD623052DD7AF6722D5C0D624B7684000A65B083DC55AEFF0C6211770B4E0A4E862026202600100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴！爆香猴！冷水猴！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B169307334FF01720699997334FF0151B76C347334FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這3隻雖然長得很像，\n但特色卻是大相徑庭。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019003396BB96D6713695775F975F8850CFFF0C000A4F4672798272537B662F592776F85F915EAD300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴頭上的葉子\n有消除疲勞的效果！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B169307334982D4E0A768484495B50000A67096D88966475B252DE76846548679CFF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爆香猴頭上的毛髮叢中\n燃燒著300度的火焰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "720699997334982D4E0A76846BDB9AEE53E24E2D000A71C371D284570033003000305EA67684706B7130FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冷水猴頭上的毛髮叢裡\n儲藏的水營養非常豐富！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B76C347334982D4E0A76846BDB9AEE53E288E1000A513285CF76846C3471DF990A975E5E388C505BCCFF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n滋補強身的葉子、營養滿分的水、\n溫度絕佳的火焰，全部湊齊了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF0100100001BE01000A6ECB88DC5F378EAB768484495B50300171DF990A6EFF520676846C343001000A6EAB5EA67D554F737684706B7130FF0C516890E86E4A9F4A4E86FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像這樣，如果活用牠們3隻的長處，\n應該就能泡出理想的茶了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF90196A23FF0C5982679C6D3B752872605011003396BB768495778655FF0C000A61C98A725C3180FD6CE151FA740660F3768483364E86FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳捉到了花椰猴牠們這3隻寶可夢，\n請把牠們借給我！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3634952304E8682B169307334726050119019003396BB5BF653EF5922FF0C000A8ACB628A72605011501F7D666211FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當我完成了理想的茶時，\n我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳第一個品嚐的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757662115B8C62104E86740660F3768483366642FF0C000A621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B37B2C4E00500B54C156907684FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴、爆香猴、冷水猴牠們\n喜歡路樹等高高的地方。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是捉到了牠們，請將牠們3隻都\n加到同行隊伍裡帶來這裡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B1693073343001720699997334300151B76C34733472605011000A559C6B618DEF6A397B499AD89AD87684573065B9300200100001BE01000A8981662F634952304E8672605011FF0C8ACB5C0772605011003396BB90FD000A52A05230540C884C968A4F0D88E15E364F86901988E1300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噢噢！那不就是\n花椰猴和爆香猴和冷水猴嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56625662FF0190A34E0D5C31662F000A82B169307334548C720699997334548C51B76C34733455CEFF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n那麼我立刻就去泡茶。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請慢慢等！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A90A39EBC62117ACB523B5C3153BB6CE18336300200100001BE00000A8ACB616261627B49FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳久等了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B34E457B494E86FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這就是花椰猴爆香猴冷水猴茶，\n正式取名為「三轅茶」！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n花椰猴爆香猴冷水猴茶實在太長了，\n而且順序容易混淆啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C31662F82B16930733472069999733451B76C3473348336FF0C000A6B635F0F53D6540D70BA300C4E098F458336300DFF0100100001BE01000A82B16930733472069999733451B76C34733483365BE65728592A95774E86FF0C000A800C4E1498065E8F5BB966136DF76DC6554A2026202600100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，這位客人！\n請品嚐這第一泡萃取的味道……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C90194F4D5BA24EBAFF01000A8ACB54C1569090197B2C4E006CE1840353D676845473905320262026FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？\n風味、香味、營養都很卓越吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F000A98A85473300199995473300171DF990A90FD5F8853538D8A5427FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！我得把這3隻\n寶可夢還給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳才是。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0162115F97628A9019003396BB000A5BF653EF592290847D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3624D662F300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳都把花椰猴、爆香猴、冷水猴\n牠們3隻借給我了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我一定會讓三轅茶登上固定菜單的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
